Package: nnm-control
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Eterix <dev@eterix.pro>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, curl, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin, eterix-updater (>= 0.5.4), eterix-keyring
Eterix-Security: no
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://eterix.pro
Description: NNM-Control — self-hosted control panel for streaming media servers
 Channels, delivery networks, certificates, LL-HLS, transcoders, playlists,
 logs and statistics of a fleet of media servers in one panel, with an agent
 on each server. Works with Nimble Streamer servers through their native API
 and the WMSPanel API.
 .
 The package installs a Docker Compose stack (stock images pinned by digest,
 the application itself comes prebuilt in the package) under /opt/nnm-control,
 generates its secrets into /etc/nnm-control (0600), publishes the panel on
 the port chosen at install time, and subscribes the product to eterix-updater.
